{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"何西阿書","commonName":"何西阿書","title":"何西阿書","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"1390c0b166f5f648615cbddd0fc0981a1b1280f32e03791ade9afbe66f074180","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["以色列和猶大不思悔改"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"「來吧，我們歸向耶和華！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂撕裂我們，也必醫治我們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂打傷我們，也必為我們包紮。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"過兩天，祂必復興我們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"第三天，祂必使我們站立起來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們好在祂面前存活。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓我們認識耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"竭力認識耶和華！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂如曙光一樣必然出現，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必像甘霖一樣臨到我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如滋潤大地的春雨。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「以法蓮啊，我該怎樣待你呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶大啊，我該怎樣待你呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們對我的愛像晨霧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如轉瞬即逝的朝露。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我藉先知砍碎你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用我的話殺戮你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的審判必如光臨到你們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要的是憐憫，而非祭物；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我喜愛人認識我，勝於燔祭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可是，你們卻如亞當一樣背約，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以詭詐待我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"基列是罪惡之城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到處血跡斑斑。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祭司如同埋伏的強盜一樣結夥打劫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在通往示劍的路上行凶作惡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在以色列家看見了可怕之事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮不忠不貞，玷污了自己。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"「猶大啊，當我使我被擄的子民返鄉時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必得到我給你定的下場","poem":1},{"noteId":12},{"text":"。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":12,"caller":"+","text":"「你必得到我給你定的下場」希伯來文是「我已經為你定下收割的時間」。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}